        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/killswitch/{size}/2116_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-18T06:07:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>They aren't being destroyed or removed from play. They are simply being shifted from one to another by \"switching.\" This is different from, say the Naturalist, who can effectively be a freaky beast hybrid, because his previous forms are later destroyed. But for all intents and purposes, Sky-scraper is one entity. All forms share the same HP, and she will always have only one character card in play.</p>",
